  "summary": "Independently read Love Received and Lived (synthesis.tex, both synthesis components, and the five-page proof) against the expansive study and exact retained evidence: Chrysostom Matthew 71 and Ephesians 9\u201311; Augustine Psalms 32, 75, 101, 118, De doctrina I.22/I.30 and De consensu II.73; Jerome Daniel II on 9:17\u201321; Bellarmine on the four chant psalms; Thomas III.79.1\u20132,6 and the relevant Super Ephesios 4.1\u20132 passages visually checked in Dessain 1857, alongside the appointed Scripture and historical oration records. PASS: the concise study interleaves all three controlling readings, preserves their material exegetical differences and four-sense distinctions, covers all ten elements, and introduces no new source-dependent claim or misleading compression; the eight sealed files remain unchanged, and this bounded content review neither claims fresh print collation of the retained transcriptions nor replaces the later final-artifact review."
